`checkFast` at `δ45q` and `checkRangeA` at `i = 32`, `64`, `W = 19` (choice point `cKat`: ties to
even, `xn = 0`, scale-first). -/

open FalconPrecision.Exec FalconPrecision.Exec.Round3

-- `ω` has order `1024`; the minimal 6-bit value `-32` is rejected; `0b111111 = -1`
/-- info: true -/
